the-firm-as-one-program-19 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-19 = unlines (cons "- **P8** Dependency certificates, effect scopes and hot swapping of running code (hyperactivity v31 §10.1–10.5)." (cons "  A retained result records everything it read, including what it found absent, so the system knows exactly when it is still valid. Effects carry their scope, so pure work is reused freely while a payment, a send or a write is never issued twice. A running program can be replaced while preserving the effects it has issued and the responses it is still waiting for (hyperactivity v31 §10.1 to §10.5, §10.7)." nil))
